EZiRmxPZVRGelUyeGtSbHB1WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["您好，感謝您撥空分享此次用餐體驗。\n\n很抱歉這次餐點呈現及服務回應未能符合您的期待，也讓您感到失望。關於您提到餐點內容與菜單照片不符，以及部分配料調整未主動告知的情況，我們非常重視您的反饋。餐點若因配方或配料調整而與菜單內容有所差異，確實應該事先向顧客說明，避免造成誤解。\n\n另外，對於同仁在說明過程中未能讓您感受到完善的服務與關心，我們也會進一步檢討並加強教育訓練，提升溝通品質。\n\n您的意見是我們改進的重要參考，我們已將相關問題轉達給門市及營運團隊檢視。再次感謝您的指教，也對本次不愉快的用餐經驗致上誠摯歉意。希望未來仍有機會為您提供更好的餐飲體驗。🙏",null,[0,17]]]],[null,null,1844,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKU2JYVlNlV1ZzYjJONFpFbFlOeTFzU2xkRlpuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x193f4425ef85adce!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjJSbXVSeWVsb2N4ZElYNy1sSldFZnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKU2JYVlNlV1ZzYjJONFpFbFlOeTFzU2xkRlpuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKU2JYVlNlV1ZzYjJONFpFbFlOeTFzU2xkRlpuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKU2JYVlNlV1ZzYjJONFpFbFlOeTFzU2xkRlpuYxILMGVSOVFhTzJpYzgaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qSlNiWFZTZVdWc2IyTjRaRWxZTnkxc1NsZEZabmMSCzBlUjlRYU8yaWM4IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARzq2F7yVEPxkqCzBlUjlRYU8yaWM4\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjN_7uovtKWAxWmk68BHZlNAYgQoykIcSgK"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiI7MGovtKWAxXygNYIHTHfHbwQ0pMFCBkoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjN_7uovtKWAxWmk68BHZlNAYgQ0pMFCGEoAQ"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25saFEzWkxaazVQVlVodGNGZE1kM0ZWWDNKNk9XYxAB",["0x0:0x193f4425ef85adce",null,1783589760323993,1783589760323993,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109229756491681087951/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Chien","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsgnt5KaCLQ25juHQf0HMuipCiCtAFo8TuLQcjgd8tWH11rKgEUQ\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109229756491681087951?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"109229756491681087951",null,168,622,null,[1,7,1],1,["在地嚮導 · 168 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjN_7uovtKWAxWmk68BHZlNAYgQpr8GCHMoAA"]]]],null,"1 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_4