！？也難怪要等待這麼久。拉麵送上來後，10分鐘完食。\n\n天府椒麻濃湯麵 ($230)：湯頭帶有濃郁的椒麻香氣，辣度適中，搭配細麵非常入味。\n黑蒜東菜湯拉麵 ($230)：黑蒜的焦香與東菜的鹹鮮契合，湯頭色澤深邃，適合喜歡重口味的朋友。\n溏心蛋 ($30)：蛋黃熟度掌握得剛好，呈現半流動的膏狀，為拉麵增添了溫潤的口感。\n\n整體而言，拉麵是真的好吃，雖然不像一般日式拉麵熬的湯頭那般濃郁飽滿Oily 的口感，但以素食拉麵來說真的不錯，唯獨出餐速度真的太慢了！",null,[0,127]]]],[null,1772800303000000,1772800303000000,"5 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfV2s4dTYzX0E4UVhUOWRxUjZwMXNIZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfV2s4dTYzX0E4UVhUOWRxUjZwMXNIZxoTQ2d3SXI1S3J6UVlRcGZlQnJ3SQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjN_7uovtKWAxWmk68BHZlNAYgQ_2MI1QEoCw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYzA1VlZrOVNTRTAxV1RGbk0xSldTalppYmxKTVlVWlNlR0l4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYzA1VlZrOVNTRTAxV1RGbk0xSldTalppYmxKTVlVWlNlR0l4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYzA1VlZrOVNTRTAxV1RGbk0xSldTalppYmxKTVlVWlNlR0l4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYzA1VlZrOVNTRTAxV1RGbk0xSldTalppYmxKTVlVWlNlR0l4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYzA1VlZrOVNTRTAxV1RGbk0xSldTalppYmxKTVlVWlNlR0l4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12466397357648748125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxYzA1VlZrOVNTRTAxV1RGbk0xSldTalppYmxKTVlVWlNlR0l4UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您的喜歡～",null,[0,7]]]],[null,null,7094,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201c05VVk9SSE01WTFnM1JWSjZiblJMYUZSeGIxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x193f4425ef85adce!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACo